# inc-h5aql: crowded slots. A Medium character's belt takes a sword but not a
# bow or a Large weapon. The bow (R), the longspear (X) and a wielded dire flail
# (in no set) are three such items for two shoulders. M is the orcish dagger
# and S the orcish knife +1, both on belts; the long sword is in the pack.
@until "SPACE:Swap" i
0 1 SPACE
t SPACE
t S
a M
a SPACE
u SPACE
b s
@until "Things in View" ESC
w
@choose "Item Acquisition"
RIGHT*9
ENTER
@until "SPACE:Swap" i
b SPACE
e X
@dump:setup-done
@until "Things in View" ESC
